- Purchases through pluggable store providers into the owned library,
  with a queue behind them for retries and a VPN-fronted egress.
- The account-tied supermix, the one YouTube builds for signed-in
  listeners; the library-seeded radio mix stands in until cookies make it
  possible.
- Bump the yt-dlp pin in the Dockerfile when YouTube changes things and
  streams stop resolving.
